   "text": "THE NINTH LEGION"
  },
  {
   "who": "narr",
   "say": "Almost two thousand years ago, their great fortress stood where York is today.",
   "cam": "overhead",
   "text": "YORK, ENGLAND"
  },
  {
   "who": "narr",
   "say": "In the year 82, enemies from the north attacked their camp at night.",
