   "text": "THEN... NOTHING"
  },
  {
   "who": "odo",
   "say": "Where did they go?",
   "cam": "close:odo",
   "do": [
    [
     "odo",
     "turn:front"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "who": "narr",
   "say": "By the year 122, a different legion was living in their fortress.",
   "cam": "overhead",
   "sfx": "suspicious"
  },
  {
   "who": "narr",
   "say": "And on a list of Rome's legions made around 165, the Ninth was simply gone.",
